# TBWC portal — production build config (subpath deploy under the MeterItPro Pages site).
#
# NOTE: VITE_BASE_PATH is NOT set here. vite.config reads it from process.env, and the
# GitHub Actions build step sets it (/<repo>/TBWCPortal/). A value here would be ignored.

# TBWC data API — its own Cloudflare Worker (deployed separately, MIP's CF account).
